Real coefficients for the element routines in this addon.

-----------------------------------

  1-100 all relevant real parameters from the stokes & viscoelastic add-on
101-150 reserve for diffuse_interface add-on
151-200 reserve for inertia add-on
201-250 reserve for generalized Stokes add-on



251 deltat: timestep in the compressible fluid model

252 Compression modulus K in the CE for the pressure:
      .
      p/K + div u = 0

253 Reference pressure p0, where the relative change in volume J=1.
    NOTE: The value of p0 is not needed in the elements for compressible flow.
          It is only used in post processing or for imposing a pressure
          constraint for setting the pressure level for steady flow.
    NOTE: The value of p0 should be equal to the initial value of the pressure
          field p in case of time-dependent computions.

254 The initial volume V0 for use in the pressure constraint.

255 The value of p_level in the linear integral pressure constraint, i.e.
    coefficients%i(308)=5.

256-300 reserved for future use
